basis aug-cc-pVDZ

scf
  xcfunc HF
end

rpa
  TheoryLevel RPA+ph
  accuracy default
  FrozenOrbitals Zn 9
  FrozenOrbitals O 1
  FrozenOrbitals H 0
end

